   "description": "VERY DANGEROUS THUNDERSTORMS are likely to produce damaging, locally destructive winds, large, possibly giant hailstones and heavy rainfall that may lead to flash flooding over the next several hours in parts of the Goldfields, South Interior and Eucla districts. Locations which may be affected include Rawlinna and Warburton.  \n          \n          Severe thunderstorms are likely to produce heavy rainfall that may lead to flash flooding over the next several hours in parts of the Gascoyne and Central West districts. Locations which may be affected include Mount Magnet, Yalgoo, Morawa and Paynes Find.  \n          \n          \n          6 CM HAIL STONES WERE OBSERVED NEAR LAVERTON AROUND 1:45 PM",
